{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01468",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.86,
      "end_seconds": 3.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Right then, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.62,
      "end_seconds": 4.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Hi, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.86,
      "end_seconds": 9.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.86,
      "end_seconds": 12.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "It's numbness in my feet, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.65,
      "end_seconds": 17.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.95,
      "end_seconds": 28.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.11,
      "end_seconds": 55.24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 111 over 78, temperature is 36.5 degrees, pulse 66."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.43,
      "end_seconds": 58.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.08,
      "end_seconds": 65.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "So, I'll explain what these mean in a moment. Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.93,
      "end_seconds": 71.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "It's been going on for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.78,
      "end_seconds": 76.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Right, how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.07,
      "end_seconds": 85.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "I'd give it a five, out of ten. Oh, and burning pain in my toes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.24,
      "end_seconds": 95.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Any being unsteady in the dark as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.19,
      "end_seconds": 106.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.96,
      "text": "Yeah. Ten days, I'd say. With being unsteady in the dark, I notice it more with darkness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.13,
      "end_seconds": 128.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Have you had any bladder problems or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.7,
      "end_seconds": 132.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.55,
      "end_seconds": 135.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "How about back pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.86,
      "end_seconds": 139.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any back pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.03,
      "end_seconds": 145.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "So, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.48,
      "end_seconds": 149.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.31,
      "end_seconds": 156.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.19,
      "end_seconds": 159.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.02,
      "end_seconds": 162.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.16,
      "end_seconds": 168.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.89,
      "end_seconds": 173.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.96,
      "end_seconds": 178.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.49,
      "end_seconds": 191.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.61,
      "text": "Right, so diabetes is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.73,
      "end_seconds": 196.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Yes, I had a varicose vein procedure, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.91,
      "end_seconds": 212.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.36,
      "end_seconds": 217.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.68,
      "end_seconds": 219.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.45,
      "end_seconds": 224.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.24,
      "end_seconds": 228.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.6,
      "end_seconds": 232.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.6,
      "end_seconds": 238.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "So, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.31,
      "end_seconds": 240.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Glibenclamide, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.47,
      "end_seconds": 243.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.68,
      "end_seconds": 249.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "5 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.07,
      "end_seconds": 256.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.42,
      "end_seconds": 259.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.62,
      "end_seconds": 276.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.85,
      "text": "The ankle reflexes are reduced and the feeling is dulled below the knees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.53,
      "end_seconds": 284.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Okay, that's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.96,
      "end_seconds": 309.06,
      "duration_seconds": 14.1,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with a peripheral neuropathy, probably related to diabetes. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.66,
      "end_seconds": 317.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.41,
      "end_seconds": 349.88,
      "duration_seconds": 31.47,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a peripheral neuropathy, probably related to diabetes, but I'd like to confirm. I'll request an HbA1c, it'll help with diabetes. I want a nerve conduction study done, that's for neuropathy. I'll request a B12 level, it'll help with neuropathy. I'm prescribing amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. That should help with nerve pain. Check both feet daily and wear well-fitting shoes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.92,
      "end_seconds": 366.25,
      "duration_seconds": 15.33,
      "text": "The neurology clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Come back in four weeks. Okay, does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.87,
      "end_seconds": 370.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Thank you, uh, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.21,
      "end_seconds": 373.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}